          "detail": "Podman 5.4.2: accepts Unix timestamps in seconds, documented calendar/RFC3339 forms, or Go duration strings such as 10m and 1h30m relative to the client machine's time. Do not supply milliseconds as an unsuffixed Unix timestamp. Zero in the numeric form denotes the Unix epoch, not a universal disable sentinel."
